From: Iscle <albertiscle9@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:51:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] MiuiCamera: Use the stock mod_device

The app reads ro.product.mod_device to tell global builds from Chinese
ones and asks for MIUI's Security Center on the latter. Use the stock
value directly instead of setting the property system-wide.
---
 smali_classes4/Te/c.smali | 2 +-
 smali_classes6/ei/c.smali | 6 +-----
2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/smali_classes4/Te/c.smali b/smali_classes4/Te/c.smali
--- a/smali_classes4/Te/c.smali
+++ b/smali_classes4/Te/c.smali
@@ -236,3 +236,3 @@
     move-result v0
-
+    const/4 v0, 0x1
     sput-boolean v0, LTe/c;->m:Z
diff --git a/smali_classes6/ei/c.smali b/smali_classes6/ei/c.smali
--- a/smali_classes6/ei/c.smali
+++ b/smali_classes6/ei/c.smali
@@ -73,8 +73,4 @@
     goto :goto_0
-
     :cond_1
-    sget-object v0, Lei/c$c;->b:Lei/c$c;
-
-    return-object v0
-
+    goto :goto_0
     :cond_2

-- 
2.56.0

